&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:4pt;margin-top:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(1) 当社の役員２名が同社の役員を兼任しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(2) 当社は同社に商品を供給しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(3) 当社は同社より商品を仕入れております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(4) 当社は同社に土地・建物の賃貸をしております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(5) 当社は同社に資金の貸付を行っております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:4pt;margin-bottom:2pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-16pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;(6) 当社は同社に債務保証をしております。&lt;/p&gt;
